      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Commander's Orders",
      "actions": 1,
      "category": "offensive",
      "traits": [
        "auditory"
      ],
      "text": "Frequency once per round\n\n---\nEffect Phoebe calls out one of the following orders to all her allies in her Hellbreakers League banner aura, letting them immediately take the associated action as a reaction.\n- On Guard! The ally can Raise a Shield, defensively position a weapon with the parry trait, or Take Cover. If the ally isn't benefiting from cover or near a feature that allows them to Take Cover, they can fall Prone as part of the reaction.\n- Send Them Back to Hell An ally who's flanking a devil, a creature that worships devils, or a creature that has a magical contract with a devil can immediately attempt a Strike.\n- To Me! The ally can Stride but must end their movement in the aura. The ally can Burrow, Climb, Fly, or Swim instead of Striding if they have the corresponding movement type."
    },
